                    insight_offtarget:      `Diagnosis fit fell short of ≥70: the journey isn't convincingly aligned to Helvern's real challenge. A liked-but-off-target programme is the classic cost of designing before diagnosing.`,
                    insight_overbudget:     `Your design exceeded the £680k envelope at some point — above £7,556 per participant against a £5,500 benchmark. Either you chose the cuts or procurement chose them for you, and it cost you margin and trust.`,
                    insight_thinmargin:     `Contribution margin fell well below the unit's 32% benchmark. Discounting to win or over-spending on faculty and venue protected the deal and eroded the economics that make custom programmes worth running.`,
